GRAMMAR.md §7.2 (DECISIONS 332): a root that is not a path string, a root project.canon does not declare, a root given twice and an empty path.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  roots {
    resource: "res"
    source: "src"
    web: "web"
  }
}
-- project.local.canon --
project acme {
  roots {
    resource: 12
    client: "/home/sam/Client"
    source: "/home/sam/Source"
    source: "/home/sam/Source2"
    web: ""
  }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1014]  project.local.canon:3:15
  root "resource" in project.local.canon must be a path string

error[E1014]  project.local.canon:4:5
  "client" in project.local.canon is not a root of project.canon (roots: resource, source, web): this file can only move a declared root

error[E1014]  project.local.canon:6:5
  "source" is given twice in project.local.canon

error[E1014]  project.local.canon:7:10
  root "web" in project.local.canon has an empty path

4 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
